From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:07:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] subst: virtual drives (3293)

subst was a stub. It now lists, makes and removes virtual drives: the drive
letter is mounted on the host directory of the path through the mount manager
(so every program sees it) and recorded under HKCU\Software\Wine\Subst with the
DOS path it stands for. Errors: Invalid parameter, Drive already SUBSTed, Path
not found. /? prints the usage.

